{
  "subject": "‮Sign in to Timlee‬",
  "text": "‮Sign in to Timlee‬\n\n‮Use the link below to sign in as ‬⁦⁨مريم@example.com⁩⁩‮. It expires at ‬⁦30‏/10‏/2026، 9:45 ص⁩‮ (‬⁦⁦15⁩‮ minutes‬⁩‮ from now) and can only be used once.‬\n\n⁦⁨https://auth.example/magic?token=secret\u0026locale=ar-xb⁩⁩\n\n‮If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email. Nobody can sign in without the link.‬\n",
  "html": "\u003c!doctype html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"ar-XB\" dir=\"rtl\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003ctitle\u003e‮Sign in to Timlee‬\u003c/title\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\n\u003cbody style=\"font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #111;\"\u003e\n  \u003ch1 style=\"font-size: 20px;\"\u003e‮Sign in to Timlee‬\u003c/h1\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003e‮Use the link below to sign in as ‬\u003cb\u003e⁦\u003cbdi\u003eمريم@example.com\u003c/bdi\u003e⁩\u003c/b\u003e‮. It expires at ‬⁦30‏/10‏/2026، 9:45 ص⁩‮ (‬⁦⁦15⁩‮ minutes‬⁩‮ from now) and can only be used once.‬\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://auth.example/magic?token=secret\u0026amp;locale=ar-xb\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 10px 16px; background: #111; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px;\"\u003e‮Sign in to Timlee‬\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #555;\"\u003e‮Or paste this link into your browser:‬\u003cbr\u003e⁦\u003cbdi\u003ehttps://auth.example/magic?token=secret\u0026amp;locale=ar-xb\u003c/bdi\u003e⁩\u003c/p\u003e\n  \u003cp style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #555;\"\u003e‮If you didn\u0026#39;t request this, you can safely ignore this email. Nobody can sign in without the link.‬\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n"
}
